====================

This file is generated by cargo-about from about.toml and about.hbs; do not
edit it by hand. Regenerate it with scripts/third-party-licenses (CI fails
when it is stale).

It has two parts. The first holds the notices of code ported or vendored into
unityrs from other projects (UnityPy and UnityPyBoost, liblz4, CPython's
standard library), and the provenance of bundled data; the notice of a new
port is added to about.hbs, and its licence to its crate's. The second holds
the licence of every crate the unityrs workspace builds, its own members
included, grouped by licence text. A crate offered under a choice of licences
(such as "MIT OR Apache-2.0") is listed under the one about.toml prefers.
liblzma-sys is also listed under 0BSD, the licence of the xz sources it
vendors and compiles.

